ps requirements; JFrog Distribution that provides software package distribution; and JFrog Connect, a device management solution that allows companies to manage software updates and monitor performance in IoT device fleets. In addition, the company offers JFrog Pro that provides access to the universal version of JFrog Artifactory and ongoing updates, upgrades, and bug fixes; JFrog Pro X, a self-managed-only subscription; JFrog Enterprise X, offers cluster configuration, federated repositories, multi-region replication, larger enterprise-scale deployments, service-level agreement support, and deeper security; and JFrog Enterprise Plus, a full platform subscription option. It serves technology, financial services, retail, healthcare, and telecommunications organizations. JFrog Ltd. was incorporated in 2008 and is headquartered in Sunnyvale, California with additional office in Netanya, Israel.","employees":1800,"website":"https://www.jfrog.com","country":"United States","city":"Sunnyvale","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Shlomi Ben Haim","title":"Co-Founder, CEO & Chairman of the Board"},{"name":"Mr. Frederic  Simon","title":"Co-Founder & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Yoav  Landman","title":"Co-Founder, CTO & Director"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":16.79,"tpe":29.21,"ps":4.264,"pfcf":24.89,"peg":1.13,"pb":4.338,"ev_ebitda":18.08,"rev_growth":0.179,"eps_growth":0.3785,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2364,"eps_growth_next":0.1865,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1242,"roa":0.0481,"de":31.49,"gross_margin":0.5305,"op_margin":0.1226,"profit_margin":0.09004,"current_ratio":1.835},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":65.13,"sector":16.79,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":-1,"sector":29.21,"verdict":"Loss-making"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":15.34,"sector":4.264,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":45.38,"sector":24.89,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":null,"sector":1.13,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":9.5